				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>移動を妨害
・固定会話</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL1（現在仮）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
