	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0801_vistor_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ふねの　うえで　しょうぶを　したり
かんぱんで　けしきを　みたり……▽
さいこう　だね　このふねは！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>船の上で　勝負を　したり
甲板で　景色を　みたり……▽
最高だね　この船は！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>移動を妨害
・固定会話</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL1（現在仮）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
