		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0801_boy4_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きひんの　ある　このふねで
じょうひんな　たたかいを　みせるよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>気品のある　この船で
上品な　戦いを　みせるよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
